      "pos": "n.",
      "zh": "看；（一）瞥；脸色；神态"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "They all "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "looked"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " happily at the teacher when he told them the good news."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "当老师告诉他们这个好消息时，他们都开心地看着他。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The famous actor kept his good "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "looks"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " even in old age."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "这位著名的演员即使年老仍保持着好看的容貌。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "She is too busy to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look after"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " her child."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "她太忙，没有时间照料孩子。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "My husband climbed down into the hole and began to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look around"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我的丈夫爬到洞下面开始四处张望。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I can "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look back"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " on things with a clear conscience."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我可以问心无愧地回首过去。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I wish you wouldn’t "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look down on"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " this kind of work."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我希望你不要看不起这种工作。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The searchers fanned out to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look for"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the missing man."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "搜寻人员四下散开寻找失踪者。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look forward to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " hearing from you in the near future."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我盼望着不久后收到你的信。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "They set up a working party to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look into"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the issue."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "他们设立了一个特别工作组来调查这个问题。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Passers-by simply "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "looked on"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " as he was attacked."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "他遭人袭击，路人只在一边袖手旁观。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "What are the symptoms to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look out"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " for?"
        }
      ],
      "zh": "有哪些症状需要注意？"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "She swiveled round to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look out of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the window."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "她转过身去望窗外。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Here’s the essay for you to "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look over"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "这篇文章请你过目。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Look through"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " your old clothes and see if there’s anything to give away."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "把你的旧衣服翻一翻，看看有没有可以送人的。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "look to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " you to support me in this matter."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "在这件事上我要靠你支持。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "looked up"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the number in the telephone directory."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "他在电话簿里查电话号码。"
    }
